{
  "id": "draft.dialogue.mano.hover",
  "kind": "dialogue",
  "title": "ほわほわアイドル",
  "status": "review",
  "version": 1,
  "rootId": "draft.dialogue.mano.hover",
  "payload": {
    "id": "dialogue.mano.hover",
    "idolId": "mano",
    "startNodeId": "01",
    "nodes": {
      "10": {
        "id": "10",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇哇……好多鸽子先生……",
        "nextNodeId": "11"
      },
      "11": {
        "id": "11",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真厉害，只要真乃在，鸽子就会聚过来。",
        "nextNodeId": "12"
      },
      "12": {
        "id": "12",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "你是真的被鸟喜欢啊。",
        "nextNodeId": "13"
      },
      "13": {
        "id": "13",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "是的，我和鸽子先生关系很好，一不小心就忘了时间。",
        "nextNodeId": "14"
      },
      "14": {
        "id": "14",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "可是，那个样子被制作人看到……呼哇哇哇……",
        "nextNodeId": "15"
      },
      "15": {
        "id": "15",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "那个……鸽子先生，我要走了，明天再来，再一起玩吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "16"
      },
      "16": {
        "id": "16",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇……怎么说呢……刚才让您看到我很不像样的一面……",
        "nextNodeId": "17"
      },
      "17": {
        "id": "17",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "鸽子的事？我觉得没什么好难为情的。",
        "nextNodeId": "18"
      },
      "18": {
        "id": "18",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "和鸽子先生慢慢说话、待在一起，真的非常开心。",
        "nextNodeId": "19"
      },
      "19": {
        "id": "19",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "可是，在别人看来，也许会觉得我太悠哉了……",
        "nextNodeId": "20"
      },
      "20": {
        "id": "20",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我从小就被说，有点迷糊、有点呼呼的。",
        "nextNodeId": "21"
      },
      "21": {
        "id": "21",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我想改变这样的自己……所以才当了偶像。",
        "nextNodeId": "22"
      },
      "22": {
        "id": "22",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……你知道偶像是什么样的工作吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "23"
      },
      "23": {
        "id": "23",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇？唱歌、跳舞……？",
        "nextNodeId": "24"
      },
      "24": {
        "id": "24",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "还有，被人喜欢。我刚才就看到了真乃被喜欢的样子。",
        "nextNodeId": "25"
      },
      "25": {
        "id": "25",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "被……鸽子先生吗？",
        "nextNodeId": "26"
      },
      "26": {
        "id": "26",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "嗯。你有做偶像的素质。",
        "nextNodeId": "27"
      },
      "27": {
        "id": "27",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "如果是你，一定能成为自己喜欢的自己。",
        "nextNodeId": "28"
      },
      "28": {
        "id": "28",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "谢谢您。听您这么说，我很高兴。",
        "nextNodeId": "29"
      },
      "29": {
        "id": "29",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "今后一起努力吧。我也会好好做制作人的工作。",
        "nextNodeId": "30"
      },
      "30": {
        "id": "30",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "好！那，差不多该到练习的时间了吧？",
        "nextNodeId": "31"
      },
      "31": {
        "id": "31",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "诶……啊，真的！我忘了算怎么回事！？",
        "nextNodeId": "32"
      },
      "32": {
        "id": "32",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "今天的练习，我也会加油的，呣嗯！"
      },
      "01": {
        "id": "01",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "真乃，原来你在这里，我找了一阵。",
        "nextNodeId": "02"
      },
      "02": {
        "id": "02",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "呼哇……制作人？",
        "nextNodeId": "03"
      },
      "03": {
        "id": "03",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "啊！难道是，已经到练习的时间了吗！？",
        "nextNodeId": "04"
      },
      "04": {
        "id": "04",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "对不起，我和鸽子先生玩得太投入了……",
        "nextNodeId": "05"
      },
      "05": {
        "id": "05",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "时间还够，吓到你了，抱歉。",
        "nextNodeId": "06"
      },
      "06": {
        "id": "06",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "还来得及吗，呼哇～太好了。",
        "nextNodeId": "07"
      },
      "07": {
        "id": "07",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "我这个人总是发呆，一不留神就真的会入迷。",
        "nextNodeId": "08"
      },
      "08": {
        "id": "08",
        "speakerId": "mano",
        "text": "不好好注意可不行，呣嗯！",
        "nextNodeId": "09"
      },
      "09": {
        "id": "09",
        "speakerId": "producer",
        "text": "……说着话的工夫，真乃身边就……",
        "nextNodeId": "10"
      }
    }
  },
  "annotations": [],
